  'New Feature - The Demi-God System': '新功能：The Demi-God System（半神系統）',
  'New Feature: Aide Affection Level Settings': '新功能：護衛好感度等級設定',
  'New Feature: Affection Improvements': '新功能：好感度系統最佳化',
