  'New Feature: New Vanguard Growth Support Event': '新功能：新先鋒養成支援活動',
  'New Feature: Priority Target': '新功能：Priority Target（優先目標）',
  'New Feature: TPS View': '新功能：TPS View（第三人稱視角）',
  'New Pass: Agent Kim Ga-young Pass': '新通行證：Agent Kim Ga-young Pass',
  'New Pass: Forge Elemental Efreeti Pass': '新通行證：Forge Elemental Efreeti Pass',
  'New Pass: Liberated Prisoner Pass': '新通行證：Liberated Prisoner Pass',
  'New Pass: Mind\'s Eye Lisandria': '新通行證：Mind’s Eye Lisandria',
  'New Pass: Radiant Swordmaiden Eugenia Pass': '新通行證：Radiant Swordmaiden Eugenia Pass',
  'New Pass: Winter Duchess Ines Pass': '新通行證：Winter Duchess Ines Pass',
  'New Event Pass: Bella Pass': '新活動通行證：Bella Pass',
  '신규 패스 : 사마리카 패스': '新通行證：莎瑪莉卡通行證（Samarika Pass）',
